      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "薄気味悪いなぁ……。\nこんな場所に出る『不気味な光』って、\nいったい何なんだろう……？",
      "jp_sha256": "b4718f8becac3c3afdd9421040a1796273d486cf916d3cda4dc86db9589839c4",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "으스스하네…….\n이런 곳에 나타난다는 ‘불길한 빛’은\n대체 뭘까……?",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 21,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b002-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
