      "serialized_row_index": 20,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "薄気味悪いなぁ……。\nこんな場所に出る『不気味な光』って、\nいったい何なんだろう……？"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "698be7897f0531e5a07b207c07218ea36debeddf8383730e67987195b265b155",
